      "language": "en",
      "content": {
        "stem": "Along a straight track, east is positive. A walker moves 6 m east and then 2 m west. What is the walker's displacement?",
        "options": {
          "A": "4 m east",
          "B": "4 m west",
          "C": "8 m east",
          "D": "8 m west"
        },
        "answerKey": "A",
        "solution": "Signed displacement is +6 m - 2 m = +4 m, so it is 4 m east. The total distance is 8 m, which is a different quantity."
      },
      "tags": [
