      "language": "en",
      "content": {
        "stem": "A particle's position on a straight line is x = 5 m + (2 m/s)t. What is the slope of its position-time graph?",
        "options": {
          "A": "7 m/s",
          "B": "5 m/s",
          "C": "2 m/s",
          "D": "0.4 m/s"
        },
        "answerKey": "C",
        "solution": "The slope is dx/dt. Differentiating x = 5 + 2t gives dx/dt = 2 m/s; the initial position 5 m does not change the slope."
      },
